[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0010","text":"────喂，美琴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0020","text":"……辛苦了\n那是……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0030","text":"哈哈，是下一套服装的设计图\n我借来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0040","text":"想着能不能给你带来一些编舞的灵感"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0050","text":"……\n以鸡尾酒为主题的礼服────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0060","text":"啊……嗯\n是前所未有的风格，非常──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0070","text":"谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0080","text":"────诶\n哦，哦……！　已经好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0090","text":"我看到了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32500100_02_0100","text":"如果穿上这个的话────\n舞蹈的意义会改变"}]
